.TH "DRACUT\-CMDLINE.SERVICE" "8" "2026-05-13" "dracut" "dracut"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.nh
.ad l
.de URL
\fI\\$2\fP <\\$1>\\$3
..
.als MTO URL
.if \n[.g] \{\
.  mso www.tmac
.  am URL
.    ad l
.  .
.  am MTO
.    ad l
.  .
.  LINKSTYLE blue R < >
.\}
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dracut-cmdline.service \- runs the dracut hooks to parse the kernel command line
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
dracut\-cmdline.service
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
This service runs all the dracut hooks to parse the kernel command line in
the initramfs.
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.sp
Harald Hoyer
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
